local ns = select(2, ...)

-- The QoL and Field report art's atlases (field-report.md › UI, qol.md › UI): where each sprite sits in its texture
-- under media/field/. Generated by the field art kit's art/field/generate.py (through art/lib/sprites.py) from the
-- approved canvas, with the texture paths moved to Pagle's; don't edit by hand. Rectangles are in texels, `scale`
-- texels per UI unit; `box` is the drawn element inside its sprite in UI units (x, y from the sprite's top left, then
-- w, h), the rest being its shadow or glow. The textures are the kit's TGAs as BLP2 with DXT5
-- (scripts/encode-blp.py): 3 MB loaded in all, each only once a frame drawn from it first shows.
--   Chart (1024 x 2048, 1.5 texels a unit, 2 MB): the Field report's sea chart, with its typed slip and without.
--   Field (1024 x 1024, 2 texels a unit, 1 MB): everything else. QoL draws its next-action button, Nudge and pinned
--     notes from it too, through its own copy of this table (Pagle_QoL/data/FieldArt.lua).

